                                "sense_id": "235d800d-6325-349d-bf18-c8482af1287b",
                                "text": "De kinderen zijn enthousiast over de aankomende schoolreis naar de dierentuin.",
                                "translation": "The children are excited about the upcoming school excursion to the zoo.",
