                                "sense_id": "235d800d-6325-349d-bf18-c8482af1287b",
                                "text": "Tijdens de schoolreizen maken de leerlingen kennis met verschillende culturele bezienswaardigheden.",
                                "translation": "During the school trips, the students get acquainted with various cultural landmarks.",
                                "english": "During the school trips, the students get acquainted with various cultural landmarks."
